00:03:50.436 --> 00:03:50.944
Aggressive.

00:03:51.496 --> 00:03:53.656
Uh, same thing with your marketing people might

00:03:53.656 --> 00:03:55.885
consistently overspend or underspend.

00:03:56.205 --> 00:03:58.216
Those are things in the mind of a CFO

00:03:58.216 --> 00:04:00.194
that we try to do some math around.

00:04:01.026 --> 00:04:03.246
Uh, this allows you to take analytics, uh,

00:04:03.325 --> 00:04:05.314
which allows you to explain it and defend it.

00:04:05.814 --> 00:04:07.555
